  "description": "Graffiti Doodle Font is a bold and playful display typeface inspired by street art and urban doodle culture.\nWith sharp angles, irregular lines, and an energetic hand-drawn style, it captures the raw spirit of graffiti while keeping a fun cartoon edge.\nPerfect for posters, album covers, branding, apparel, stickers, and digital art, this font adds attitude and character to every project. Its irregular strokes and freestyle forms make each letter feel alive, like sketches straight from a wall mural. Both OTF and TTF files are included, giving designers flexibility to use them across print and digital platforms.\nWith a unique mix of graffiti expression and cartoon playfulness, Graffiti Doodle is ideal for projects that demand boldness, creativity, and urban authenticity.",
  "fullDescription": "<p><strong>Graffiti Doodle Font is a bold and playful display typeface inspired by street art and urban doodle culture.</strong></p>\n<p>With sharp angles, irregular lines, and an energetic hand-drawn style, it captures the raw spirit of graffiti while keeping a fun cartoon edge.</p>\n<p><strong>Perfect for posters, album covers, branding, apparel,</strong> stickers, and digital art, this font adds attitude and character to every project. Its irregular strokes and freestyle forms make each letter feel alive, like sketches straight from a wall mural. Both OTF and TTF files are included, giving designers flexibility to use them across print and digital platforms.</p>\n<p>With a unique mix of <strong>graffiti expression and cartoon playfulness, Graffiti Doodle</strong> is ideal for projects that demand boldness, creativity, and urban authenticity.</p>",
